pe=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCorporate Governance is the allocation of authority, roles and responsibilities within a company.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-593cf0d\" data-id=\"593cf0d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8d1e14 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f8d1e14\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Since inception Arqaam Group has operated on the basis that good Corporate Governance is good business and adherence to high standards of corporate governance in accordance with international best practice creates long term value for all stakeholders. Accordingly, Arqaam Group has adopted a corporate governance structure which is appropriate for its size, business profile and status (including appropriate controls, documented policies and procedures, and fit and proper individuals); but which also takes into account the fact that it is currently a private unlisted company.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-758ba7e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"758ba7e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e